# Third-party schema files. Do not commit.
#
# These are other people's code, mostly unlicensed, so redistributing them is
# not ours to do. data/corpus.tsv records the repository and blob SHA of every
# schema, so the corpus is reproducible without shipping the files:
#   https://api.github.com/repos/<repo>/git/blobs/<sha>
#
# DELETE data/schemas/ when the study is finished and the article is published.
data/schemas/

# Copies whole model blocks out of those schemas for manual review. Record the
# verdicts somewhere code-free (repo, sha, model, field, verdict, reason)
# before deleting this.
data/verification.md

# Run logs.
data/*.log

# Prisma's schema validator, installed only for the cross-check.
node_modules/
package-lock.json
